---
title: "enter_market_inner (Pebble Protocol: Lending Entry Points)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_version: ensure_version_matches()
    q_version --> q_validate: validate_market(market)
    q_validate --> q_emode_check: assert_emode_group_exists(emode_group)
    q_emode_check --> q_circuit_break: check circuit_break
    q_circuit_break --> q_error_cb: circuit_break triggered
    q_error_cb --> [*]: abort market_under_circuit_break
    q_circuit_break --> q_create_obligation: obligation::new(market_id, emode_group, ctx)
    q_create_obligation --> q_register: handle_new_obligation(obligation)
    q_register --> q_emit: emit ObligationCreatedEvent
    q_emit --> [*]: return obligation_cap

    note right of q_create_obligation
        INV-001: emode group must exist in registry
        INV-002: obligation is stored as shared object in market
        INV-003: obligation_cap ID matches obligation object ID
        INV-004: each obligation belongs to exactly one market
    end note
